  "id": "hu-iskolai-szunetek",
  "name": "Magyar iskolai szünetek (2014–2026) — többnyelvű (HU/DE/EN)",
  "title": "Magyar iskolai szünetek (2014–2026) — többnyelvű (HU/DE/EN)",
  "description": "Hungarian school vacations (iskolai szünetek) covering the 2014/2015 through 2025/2026 school years (49 records) from the OpenHolidays editorial seed (openpotato/openholidaysapi.data). RegionalScope=National for all 49 entries (Hungary has a uniform national school calendar issued annually by the Oktatási Hivatal; no per-vármegye split). Four vacation stems: Őszi szünet (Autumn break, typ. late Oct/early Nov), Téli szünet (Winter break, Dec/Jan), Tavaszi szünet (Spring break, around Easter), Nyári szünet (Summer break, mid-June through end-August). FIRST hu-iskolai-* dataset in the project. Each record carries Hungarian, German, and English names plus duration_days for the calendar span. Three records appear in some school years for cases where the seed publishes both an Autumn and a second observance; we preserve the upstream record set verbatim.",
